# Build-time vars (vite build inlines these).
# Required by the deploy scripts: they set VITE_REQUIRE_TURNSTILE=1, and the
# build rejects missing or test site keys. Deployed APIs also require the
# matching runtime secret and protection bindings; see docs/maintainers/FREE_TOOLS_PROTECTION.md.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Local runtime secrets go in web/.dev.vars (gitignored), not this file.
# The website does not inherit the repository root's .env.local. Add
# DATAFORSEO_API_KEY=<your existing base64 API credential> to web/.dev.vars
# and restart the website dev server to test real SEO results.
# Domain Age Checker and SERP Simulator work without this key.
#
# Deployed runtime secrets — set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, not here:
#   DATAFORSEO_API_KEY    base64("login:password") for api.dataforseo.com
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY  pairs with VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY; required in deployed
#                         environments alongside rate-limit and budget bindings
#   LOOPS_API_KEY         newsletter subscribe endpoint
